WEBVTT

00:00:11.112 --> 00:00:12.432
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.712
SOUR BILL: Citizens of Sugar Rush...

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.592
Just in time.

00:00:24.552 --> 00:00:29.232
...all hail our rightful ruler, King Candy.

00:00:29.512 --> 00:00:32.552
Hello, my royal subjects!

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.072
Ha-ha! Have some candy!

00:00:35.312 --> 00:00:36.832
(ALL CHEERING)

00:00:37.192 --> 00:00:40.792
Thank you for that
stirring introduction, Sour Bill.

00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:41.912
Mmm-hmm.

00:00:41.992 --> 00:00:44.832
And thank you to today's avatars.

00:00:45.032 --> 00:00:47.832
It was a wonderful day of racing. It was.

00:00:47.952 --> 00:00:49.632
But now the arcade is closed,

00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:51.952
so it's time to wipe the slate clean

00:00:52.032 --> 00:00:54.552
and race to decide our new roster.

00:00:56.552 --> 00:00:58.072
The first nine racers
across that finish line

00:00:59.672 --> 00:01:03.832
will represent Sugar Rush
as tomorrow's avatars!

00:01:03.992 --> 00:01:05.312
ALL: (CHANTING) Race! Race! Race!

00:01:05.912 --> 00:01:07.752
KING CANDY: Okay, calm down.

00:01:08.032 --> 00:01:11.752
Listen! This event is pay-to-play.
We all know this.

00:01:11.992 --> 00:01:14.392
The fee to compete is one gold coin

00:01:14.512 --> 00:01:16.552
from your previous winnings,

00:01:16.712 --> 00:01:19.352
if you've ever won, which I have.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.312
Let me go first!

00:01:27.032 --> 00:01:28.392
ANNOUNCER: King Candy!

00:01:28.472 --> 00:01:29.552
(ALL CHANTING)

00:01:29.752 --> 00:01:31.032
(LAUGHING)

00:01:36.592 --> 00:01:37.752
ANNOUNCER: Taffyta Muttonfudge!

00:01:37.872 --> 00:01:38.912
Stay sweet!

00:01:40.512 --> 00:01:42.592
Adorabeezle Winterpop.

00:01:43.592 --> 00:01:45.232
Gloyd Orangeboar!

00:01:45.552 --> 00:01:47.032
(RALPH GRUNTING)

00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:50.952
RALPH: Little stealer!
Wait till I catch that brat.

00:01:51.072 --> 00:01:54.272
ANNOUNCER: Minty Zaki.
Snowanna Rainbeau.

00:01:54.912 --> 00:01:58.232
Rancis Fluggerbutter.
Jubileena Bing-Bing.

00:01:59.592 --> 00:02:01.032
Swizzle Malarkey.

00:02:02.232 --> 00:02:03.552
Candlehead.

00:02:09.432 --> 00:02:10.592
(COIN TINKLING)

00:02:11.432 --> 00:02:13.392
Sour Bill, who's that last one?

00:02:17.112 --> 00:02:19.112
ANNOUNCER:
Vanellope von Schweetz!

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.392
Yippee! I'm in the race!

00:02:21.472 --> 00:02:22.552
Vanellope?

00:02:23.752 --> 00:02:25.432
(GASPS) The Glitch!

00:02:25.592 --> 00:02:26.592
(SCREAMING)

00:02:26.952 --> 00:02:29.232
KING CANDY: Now, now! (LAUGHS)

00:02:29.312 --> 00:02:32.792
Everything is all right! Security!

00:02:33.112 --> 00:02:34.112
Come here, kid!

00:02:34.272 --> 00:02:36.472
We're not going to hurt you,
you little freak!

00:02:36.552 --> 00:02:37.592
(SCREAMING)

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.072
Get back here!

00:02:40.152 --> 00:02:41.392
Slow down! Slow down a little bit.

00:02:43.272 --> 00:02:44.632
(RALPH GRUNTING)

00:02:45.992 --> 00:02:49.272
You! Give me back my medal right now!

00:02:49.472 --> 00:02:50.912
-Ah, boy!
-Go!

00:02:51.432 --> 00:02:52.472
What is that?

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:54.432
WYNNCHEL: Come on! Go! Roll!

00:02:54.512 --> 00:02:55.952
(GRUNTING)

00:03:01.672 --> 00:03:02.912
(GROWLING)

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:09.152
Careful! What are you doing?

00:03:14.632 --> 00:03:15.672
Huh?

00:03:17.672 --> 00:03:18.792
(LAUGHING)

00:03:18.872 --> 00:03:20.112
Come back here!

00:03:22.832 --> 00:03:23.832
I can't move!

00:03:23.992 --> 00:03:25.432
Now we got him!

00:03:25.832 --> 00:03:28.152
Oh, good, the cops. She went that way!

00:03:28.272 --> 00:03:29.792
-Hold still!
-Take that!

00:03:29.872 --> 00:03:30.912
Ow! What are you doing?

00:03:30.992 --> 00:03:32.512
Okay, folks. (STAMMERS)

00:03:32.832 --> 00:03:35.472
Calm down! Everything's all right.

00:03:35.712 --> 00:03:37.672
The monster's been caught!

00:03:37.952 --> 00:03:39.712
We'll repair all the damage.

00:03:40.832 --> 00:03:43.552
Don't worry. We will have our race
before the arcade opens.

00:03:44.352 --> 00:03:47.352
And I'm in it. Yes!

00:03:51.512 --> 00:03:54.672
There's no way that
I am racing with a glitch.

00:03:54.832 --> 00:03:56.552
Rancis, Candlehead, come on.

00:03:56.872 --> 00:04:01.352
Sour Bill, that glitch
cannot be allowed to race!

00:04:01.472 --> 00:04:03.712
And bring that thing to my castle.

00:04:03.912 --> 00:04:05.512
Guys! She took...

00:04:05.592 --> 00:04:07.032
(SCREAMING)

00:04:07.872 --> 00:04:10.592
(OREOS CHANTING)

00:04:10.952 --> 00:04:14.312
Or-e-oh
Oreo!

00:04:15.192 --> 00:04:16.432
Or-e-oh

00:04:18.952 --> 00:04:20.232
(MUMBLING)

00:04:21.552 --> 00:04:23.272
(HORN HONKING)

00:04:25.192 --> 00:04:26.872
(BEEPING)

00:04:27.752 --> 00:04:30.712
Sour Bill, de-taffify this monster

00:04:30.872 --> 00:04:32.552
so we can see
what we're up against here.

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:33.832
Mm-kay.

00:04:34.952 --> 00:04:35.992
(SCREAMS)

00:04:36.352 --> 00:04:38.712
Milk my duds! It's Wreck-It Ralph?

00:04:38.912 --> 00:04:41.872
Yeah. Who are you,
the guy that makes the donuts?

00:04:41.952 --> 00:04:44.952
(LAUGHS) Please. No. I'm King Candy!

00:04:46.032 --> 00:04:47.432
I see you're a fan of pink.

00:04:47.632 --> 00:04:49.792
Salmon. Salmon, that's obviously...

00:04:49.952 --> 00:04:51.552
What are you doing here?

00:04:51.712 --> 00:04:55.832
Look, Your Candiness,
this is just a big misunderstanding.

00:04:55.912 --> 00:04:57.552
Just get me out of this cupcake,

00:04:57.632 --> 00:04:59.632
I'll get my medal,
and I'll be out of your way.

00:04:59.912 --> 00:05:03.552
Your medal? (LAUGHS)
Bad guys don't win medals.

00:05:03.672 --> 00:05:05.192
Well, this one did.

00:05:05.272 --> 00:05:07.152
I earned it over in Hero's Duty.

00:05:07.272 --> 00:05:08.312
You game-jumped?

00:05:08.392 --> 00:05:11.032
Ralph, you're not going Turbo, are you?

00:05:11.232 --> 00:05:12.432
What? No, no.

00:05:12.592 --> 00:05:16.072
Because if you think you can
come in here to my kingdom

00:05:16.152 --> 00:05:18.592
and take over my game,
you've got another thing coming!

00:05:18.952 --> 00:05:20.392
Easy, Your Puffiness.

00:05:20.472 --> 00:05:22.152
It's not my fault one of your children

00:05:22.232 --> 00:05:24.072
of the candy corn stole my medal.

00:05:24.232 --> 00:05:26.392
"Children of the candy corn"? Who'd...

00:05:27.072 --> 00:05:28.112
The Glitch!

00:05:28.272 --> 00:05:30.632
The coin she used to
buy her way into the race.

00:05:30.712 --> 00:05:31.752
That was your medal?

00:05:31.872 --> 00:05:34.072
She did what? I need that back!

00:05:34.232 --> 00:05:36.952
Well, I'm afraid I can't help you.
It's gone, you know.

00:05:37.032 --> 00:05:39.472
It's nothing but code now.

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:42.632
It will stay that way
until someone wins the cup

00:05:42.712 --> 00:05:44.032
at the end of the race.

00:05:44.232 --> 00:05:46.432
Maybe I'll have to have a little talk

00:05:46.512 --> 00:05:47.632
with the winner then.

00:05:47.712 --> 00:05:49.592
Is that a threat I smell?

00:05:50.592 --> 00:05:54.272
Beyond the halitosis
you so obviously suffer from.

00:05:54.352 --> 00:05:57.832
Listen, Nilly-Wafer,
I'm not leaving without my medal!

00:05:57.952 --> 00:05:59.432
Yes, you are.

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:02.432
Wynnchel, Duncan,
get him out of that cupcake

00:06:02.712 --> 00:06:04.272
and on the first train back home.

00:06:04.352 --> 00:06:06.712
If I ever see you here again,
Wreck-It Ralph,

00:06:07.512 --> 00:06:09.432
I'll lock you in my fungeon.

00:06:09.632 --> 00:06:10.672
Fungeon?

00:06:10.872 --> 00:06:13.512
Fun dungeon, you know?
It's a play on words.

00:06:13.912 --> 00:06:15.152
(CHUCKLES) It's the...

00:06:15.632 --> 00:06:19.672
Never mind! I've got a glitch
to deal with, thanks to you.

00:06:19.832 --> 00:06:23.592
Goodbye, Wreck-it Ralph!
It hasn't been a pleasure.

00:06:28.232 --> 00:06:29.232
This thing is hard as a rock.

00:06:29.312 --> 00:06:30.352
I can see that.

00:06:30.432 --> 00:06:31.832
-Get the tools.
-What tools?

00:06:31.912 --> 00:06:33.432
-Quiet, you!
-Ow!

00:06:35.192 --> 00:06:36.472
What? No!

00:06:36.552 --> 00:06:38.312
-Take it easy, big boy!
-Stay away from me!

00:06:38.392 --> 00:06:39.472
He's getting away!

00:06:44.552 --> 00:06:46.952
Quick! Call out the Devil Dogs.

00:06:47.432 --> 00:06:48.512
(SNIFFING)

00:06:50.192 --> 00:06:51.712
(BARKING)

00:06:59.792 --> 00:07:02.632
(BREATHING)

00:07:03.432 --> 00:07:05.192
Chocolate. I hate chocolate!

00:07:07.512 --> 00:07:08.912
I got to get my medal back.

00:07:13.552 --> 00:07:15.592
The pot goes to the winning racer!

00:07:15.672 --> 00:07:17.792
Hey, kids!
Can I talk to you for a second?

